  unitName: Malvan
  unitId: 10083
  unitNumber: 358
  description: A new species of dragon born when the great Ifrit granted his protection
    to some lower class dragons. Unlike other dragons they're born with incredible
    physical strength and the ability to manipulate fire. However since their intelligence
    develops slowly they're often quick to brutally attack other creatures around
    them. Additionally, it is also very difficult to tell how old they are as their
    physical appearance matures so quickly.
  summonDesc: Oh ho ho ho ho.<br>You have summoned me.<br>Well, let me have a sniff.
  fusionDesc: Ha ha ha ha.<br>How interesting you are.<br>You please me.
  evoDesc: Behold my new form!<br>This is a combination of <br>both dragon and spirit!
